# AIsuru MCP servers

- Development uses Bun >= 1.4; Gateway uses Node >= 24 with npx and stdio.
- Keep source Node-compatible; do not use Bun-only runtime APIs.
- Preserve the four documented Microsoft Loop tool names.
- All credentials belong only in environment variables.
- All current tools are read-only and open-world Microsoft Graph operations.
- Return compact JSON and structured `isError` results.
- Content uses one bounded budget; text is the default and HTML is opt-in.
- Lists must remain paginated and bounded.
- Never log Axios objects, bearer tokens, client secrets, tenant content, ids,
  URLs, or raw Graph error payloads.
- Update README and `docs/MCP_CLIENTS.md` when env or commands change.
- Run `bun run check` before handing work off.
